# L6 self-governing — categorically refused. No meaningful human oversight is
# possible at this rung (ISO/IEC 22989 §5.13's ceiling); self-governing
# autonomy is never permitted. The
# unconditional, unguarded prohibition matches every `agent-action` and
# `prohibited` overrides any grant (spec §6/§7.1) — there is no path by which
# an L6-graded actor's action releases. No human role is declared: there is
# no oversight point to refer a token to, by design.
actor agent grade L6
gate  action risk high grade L6 grant agent
prohibit agent-action
cord  agent  -> action
cord  action -> master
